.TH RT_TGSIGQUEUEINFO 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
rt_tgsigqueueinfo \- Linux x86-64 syscall 297
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/syscall_260_299.h>
.B int rt_tgsigqueueinfo(pid_t process, pid_t thread, int signal, const siginfo_t* information);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Queues signal information to a specific thread.
This is a direct Linux x86-64 syscall wrapper; availability and permissions depend on the kernel and security policy.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set on failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rt_tgsigqueueinfo (2)
